the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1 - 9 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4 \\arcsin{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "e8920fd5-05ee-5720-bd2b-8aca4753ae8f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "e8920fd5-05ee-5720-bd2b-8aca4753ae8f" :question/answer-fields "363b6f56-3eb2-5b87-a8ce-bd3ab3936383"] [:db/ensure "e8920fd5-05ee-5720-bd2b-8aca4753ae8f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "e8920fd5-05ee-5720-bd2b-8aca4753ae8f"] [:db/add "39509661-93b5-5e4e-ae9d-563c2ee4f646" :answer/id #uuid "39509661-93b5-5e4e-ae9d-563c2ee4f646"] [:db/add "39509661-93b5-5e4e-ae9d-563c2ee4f646" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "39509661-93b5-5e4e-ae9d-563c2ee4f646" :answer/value "- \\frac{3 \\arcsin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "39509661-93b5-5e4e-ae9d-563c2ee4f646" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3e839ceb-2144-52b0-b754-2a44fae98692" :answer/id #uuid "3e839ceb-2144-52b0-b754-2a44fae98692"] [:db/add "3e839ceb-2144-52b0-b754-2a44fae98692" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3e839ceb-2144-52b0-b754-2a44fae98692" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}}{4}+C"] [:db/ensure "3e839ceb-2144-52b0-b754-2a44fae98692" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1c167790-e2e4-5c8a-885d-0f520dd0bf84" :answer/id #uuid "1c167790-e2e4-5c8a-885d-0f520dd0bf84"] [:db/add "1c167790-e2e4-5c8a-885d-0f520dd0bf84" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1c167790-e2e4-5c8a-885d-0f520dd0bf84" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\arcsin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4}+C"] [:db/ensure "1c167790-e2e4-5c8a-885d-0f520d