\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "c653ac84-0fa8-5e37-9b59-40220d9afb3a" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{3}{2}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{1 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3 \\arcsin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "c653ac84-0fa8-5e37-9b59-40220d9afb3a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "c653ac84-0fa8-5e37-9b59-40220d9afb3a" :question/answer-fields "8af62559-54d6-5658-addb-6beb28396a64"] [:db/ensure "c653ac84-0fa8-5e37-9b59-40220d9afb3a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "c653ac84-0fa8-5e37-9b59-40220d9afb3a"] [:db/add "258987f0-0912-531f-962e-71b2f10664f0" :answer/id #uuid "258987f0-0912-531f-962e-71b2f10664f0"] [:db/add "258987f0-0912-531f-962e-71b2f10664f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "258987f0-0912-531f-962e-71b2f10664f0" :answer/value "\\frac{\\arcsin{\\left(8 x \\right)}}{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "258987f0-0912-531f-962e-71b2f10664f0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4f6df3cd-0317-5314-9f7a-13aa01175468" :answer/id #uuid "4f6df3cd-0317-5314-9f7a-13aa01175468"] [:db/add "4f6df3cd-0317-5314-9f7a-13aa01175468" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4f6df3cd-0317-5314-9f7a-13aa01175468" :answer/value "- \\frac{\\arcsin{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{4}+C"] [:db/ensure "4f6df3cd-0317-5314-9f7a-13aa01175468" :answ