128-0f93-5e77-9a55-b52d5d3a4db0" :answer-field/choices "01335fbd-f788-5642-88bb-afc76dc4e773"] [:db/add "f0393128-0f93-5e77-9a55-b52d5d3a4db0" :answer-field/choices "c5af1135-a9dd-5888-b4d1-14a4ca79e24b"] [:db/add "f0393128-0f93-5e77-9a55-b52d5d3a4db0" :answer-field/choices "22724234-eab1-5f2a-9c70-e8c1f1a08172"] [:db/add "f0393128-0f93-5e77-9a55-b52d5d3a4db0" :answer-field/choices "947bea71-b94d-5e17-898b-222775f381b9"] [:db/add "f0393128-0f93-5e77-9a55-b52d5d3a4db0" :answer-field/choices "58638a14-d14e-5350-ab65-19e7d56745fc"] [:db/add "f0393128-0f93-5e77-9a55-b52d5d3a4db0" :answer-field/correct "c5af1135-a9dd-5888-b4d1-14a4ca79e24b"] [:db/ensure "f0393128-0f93-5e77-9a55-b52d5d3a4db0" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "5a453eb3-b25d-5e4d-b90f-9951f5d21249" :question/id #uuid "5a453eb3-b25d-5e4d-b90f-9951f5d21249"] [:db/add "5a453eb3-b25d-5e4d-b90f-9951f5d21249" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "5a453eb3-b25d-5e4d-b90f-9951f5d21249" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=\\frac{3}{5}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3 \\arcsin{\\left(5 x \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "5a453eb3-b25d-5e4d-b90f-9951f5d21249" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "5a453eb3-b25d