 :answer/validate] [:db/add "4c89a94e-8dac-5020-b377-b0010d25554c" :answer-field/id #uuid "4c89a94e-8dac-5020-b377-b0010d25554c"] [:db/add "4c89a94e-8dac-5020-b377-b0010d25554c" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "4c89a94e-8dac-5020-b377-b0010d25554c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "4c89a94e-8dac-5020-b377-b0010d25554c" :answer-field/choices "75cbde47-c1b2-57e6-adfa-5bc3ac2e511c"] [:db/add "4c89a94e-8dac-5020-b377-b0010d25554c" :answer-field/choices "2b2414fd-3152-5651-b62d-b134ab66c66e"] [:db/add "4c89a94e-8dac-5020-b377-b0010d25554c" :answer-field/choices "dc03112e-6d26-5ec3-b40d-6cabdcb51b66"] [:db/add "4c89a94e-8dac-5020-b377-b0010d25554c" :answer-field/choices "4a00a630-a3ba-5e52-a51f-3f19122d71f5"] [:db/add "4c89a94e-8dac-5020-b377-b0010d25554c" :answer-field/choices "b0cb8cbe-bb71-5199-890b-d9d45457c101"] [:db/add "4c89a94e-8dac-5020-b377-b0010d25554c" :answer-field/correct "2b2414fd-3152-5651-b62d-b134ab66c66e"] [:db/ensure "4c89a94e-8dac-5020-b377-b0010d25554c" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a4943ed8-883a-5886-8017-ec637b60e59b" :question/id #uuid "a4943ed8-883a-5886-8017-ec637b60e59b"] [:db/add "a4943ed8-883a-5886-8017-ec637b60e59b" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "a4943ed8-883a-5886-8017-ec637b60e59b" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2 \\arcsin{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "a4943ed8-883a-5886-8017-ec637b60e59b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "a4943ed8-883a-5886-8017-ec637b60e59b" :question/answer-fields "4c89a94e-8dac-5020-b377-b0010d25554c"] [:db/ensure "a4943ed8-883a-5886-8017-ec637b60e59b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "a4943ed8-883a-5886-8017-ec637b60e59b"] [:db/add "6701e43a-9ec0-543e-80b3-6652dc00cb34" :answer/id #uuid "6701e43a-9ec0-543e-80b3-6652dc00cb34"] [:db/add "6701e43a-9ec0-543e-80b3-6652dc00cb34" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6701e43a-9ec0-543e-80b3-6652dc00cb34" :answer/value "- 4 \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "6701e43a-9ec0-543e-80b3-6652dc00cb34" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b6895503-0c2a-527c-b32e-4423718364be" :answer/id #uuid "b6895503-0c2a-527c-b32e-4423718364be"] [:db/add "b6895503-0c2a-527c-b32e-4423718364be" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b6895503-0c2a-527c-b32e-4423718364be" :answer/value "8 \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{6} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "b6895503-0c2a-527c-b32e-4423718364be" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9b9cf281-8a03-5e20-952f-c49270c03e58" :answer/id #uuid "9b9cf281-8a03-5e20-952f-c49270c03e58"] [:db/add "9b9cf281-8a03-5e20-952f-c49270c03e58" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9b9cf281-8a03-5e20-952f-c49270c03e58" :answer/value "2 \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{6} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "9b9cf281-8a03-5e20-952f-c49270c03e58" :answer/validate] [:db/add "40f05856-5191-55df-94e1-5f392d3e2903" :answer/id #uuid "40f05856-5191-55df-94e1-5f392d3e2903"] [:db/add "40f05856-5191-55df-94e1-5f392d3e2903" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "40f05856-5191-55df-94e1-5f392d3e2903" :answer/value "4 \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "40f05856-5191-55df-94e1-5f392d3e2903" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2e980fc7-96a9-5d08-81ee-beaef687cc29" :answer/id #uuid "2e980fc7-96a9-5d08-81ee-beaef687cc29"] [:db/add "2e980fc7-96a9-5d08-81ee-beaef687cc29" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2e980fc7-96a9-5d08-81ee-beaef687cc29" :answer/value "2 \\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "2e980fc7-96a9-5d08-81ee-beaef687cc29" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ae0a394c-aec7-5b8c-b3d0-ee1558820ce5" :answer-field/id #uuid "ae0a394c-aec7-5b8c-b3d0-ee1558820ce5"] [:db/add "ae0a394c-aec7-5b8c-b3d0-ee1558820ce5" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "ae0a394c-aec7-5b8c-b3d0-ee1558820ce5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "ae0a394c-aec7-5b8c-b3d0-ee1558820ce5" :answer-field/choices "6701e43a-9ec0-543e-80b3-6652dc00cb34"] [:db/add "ae0a394c-aec7-5b8c-b3d0-ee1558820ce5" :answer-field/choices "b6895503-0c2a-527c-b32e-4423718364be"] [:db/add "ae0a394c-aec7-5b8c-b3d0-ee1558820ce5" :answer-field/choices "9b9cf281-8a03-5e20-952f-c49270c03e58"] [:db/add "ae0a394c-aec7-5b8c-b3d0-ee1558820ce5" :answer-field/choices "40f05856-5191-55df-94e1-5f392d3e2903"] [:db/add "ae0a394c-aec7-5b8c-b3d0-ee1558820ce5" :answer-field/choices "2e980fc7-96a9-5d08-81ee-beaef687cc29"] [:db/add "ae0a394c-aec7-5b8c-b3d0-ee1558820ce5" :answer-field/correct "40f05856-5191-55df-94e1-5f392d3e2903"] [:db/ensure "ae0a394c-aec7-5b8c-b3d0-ee1558820ce5" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c1910fb8-4fac-5701-9913-109b53af9508" :question/id #uuid "c1910fb8-4fac-5701-9913-109b53af9508"] [:db/add "c1910fb8-4fac-5701-9913-109b53af9508" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "c1910fb8-4fac-5701-9913-109b53af9508" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=3\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{3})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{4}{3}\\cdot 3=4$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=4\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=4\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n4 \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "c1910fb8-4fac-5701-9913-109b53af9508" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "c1910fb8-4fac-5701-9913-109b53af9508" :question/answer-fields "ae0a394c-aec7-5b8c-b3d0-ee1558820ce5"] [:db/ensure "c1910fb8-4fac-5701-9913-109b53af9508" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "c1910fb8-4fac-5701-9913-109b53af9508"] [:db/add "72754237-5755-547a-a26c-337efdc51e2a" :answer/id #uuid "72754237-5755-547a-a26c-337efdc51e2a"] [:db/add "72754237-5755-547a-a26c-337efdc51e2a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "72754237-5755-547a-a26c-337efdc51e2a" :answer/value "\\frac{\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{5} \\right)}}{25}+C"] [:db/ensure "72754237-5755-547a-a26c-337efdc51e2a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0ffa4a1e-4c20-5ffa-8f8b-a78c5995288e" :answer/id #uuid "0ffa4a1e-4c20-5ffa-8f8b-a78c5995288e"] [:db/add "0ffa4a1e-4c20-5ffa-8f8b-a78c5995288e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0ffa4a1e-4c20-5ffa-8f8b-a78c5995288e" :answer/value "\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{5} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "0ffa4a1e-4c20-5ffa-8f8b-a78c5995288e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ac1bba76-0318-5c97-a3f8-8d12ff8a94f4" :answer/id #uuid "ac1bba76-0318-5c97-a3f8-8d12ff8a94f4"] [:db/add "ac1bba76-0318-5c97-a3f8-8d12ff8a94f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ac1bba76-0318-5c97-a3f8-8d12ff8a94f4" :answer/value "\\frac{\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{5} \\right)}}{5}+C"] [:db/ensure "ac1bba76-0318-5c97-a3f8-8d12ff8a94f4" :answer/val