x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "f6dc0554-3d98-5d93-aa71-2ac7a77b028c" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{5}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{25 - x^{2}}=5\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{5})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=5\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot 5=1$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{25 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{5} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "f6dc0554-3d98-5d93-aa71-2ac7a77b028c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "f6dc0554-3d98-5d93-aa71-2ac7a77b028c" :question/answer-fields "b8f7e78f-d426-5e47-bd5b-09f42723cc3b"] [:db/ensure "f6dc0554-3d98-5d93-aa71-2ac7a77b028c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "f6dc0554-3d98-5d93-aa71-2ac7a77b028c"] [:db/add "b6855eac-0a08-5c55-8679-d167635075e6" :answer/id #uuid "b6855eac-0a08-5c55-8679-d167635075e6"] [:db/add "b6855eac-0a08-5c55-8679-d167635075e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b6855eac-0a08-5c55-8679-d167635075e6" :answer/value "\\frac{\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{4} \\right)}}{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "b6855eac-0a08-5c55-8679-d167635075e6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7cf7281e-fddd-526f-b891-8f4452470dd4" :answer/id #uuid "7cf7281e-fddd-526f-b891-8f4452470dd4"] [:db/add "7cf7281e-fddd-526f-b891-8f4452470dd4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7cf7281e-fddd-526f-b891-8f4452470dd4" :answer/value "\\frac{\\arcsin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}+C"] [:db/ensure "7cf7281e-fddd-526f-b891-8f4452470dd4" :answe