constant."] [:db/add "297ac9e7-b8a9-5a3b-962d-5f582cebfb0f" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=3\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{3})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot 3=3$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3 \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "297ac9e7-b8a9-5a3b-962d-5f582cebfb0f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "297ac9e7-b8a9-5a3b-962d-5f582cebfb0f" :question/answer-fields "abfa6f16-fc35-529a-95a5-08ae3ba44114"] [:db/ensure "297ac9e7-b8a9-5a3b-962d-5f582cebfb0f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "297ac9e7-b8a9-5a3b-962d-5f582cebfb0f"] [:db/add "002c5c39-469c-54ce-95c3-cc968a55b507" :answer/id #uuid "002c5c39-469c-54ce-95c3-cc968a55b507"] [:db/add "002c5c39-469c-54ce-95c3-cc968a55b507" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "002c5c39-469c-54ce-95c3-cc968a55b507" :answer/value "2 \\arcsin{\\left(x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "002c5c39-469c-54ce-95c3-cc968a55b507" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9c11247c-5fa6-56e3-bcfa-6975431561ee" :answer/id #uuid "9c11247c-5fa6-56e3-bcfa-6975431561ee"] [:db/add "9c11247c-5fa6-56e3-bcfa-6975431561ee" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9c11247c-5fa6-56e3-bcfa-6975431561ee" :answer/value "- 2 \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "9c11247c-5fa6-56e3-bcfa-6975431561ee" :answer/validate] [:db/add "069fca0a-945b-56a7-a70f-e70dd99