-53c8-a2f1-399c3ef53b26" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a10c7c13-1209-5f90-bdd5-131203ee4deb" :question/id #uuid "a10c7c13-1209-5f90-bdd5-131203ee4deb"] [:db/add "a10c7c13-1209-5f90-bdd5-131203ee4deb" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "a10c7c13-1209-5f90-bdd5-131203ee4deb" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot 2=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2 \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "a10c7c13-1209-5f90-bdd5-131203ee4deb" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "a10c7c13-1209-5f90-bdd5-131203ee4deb" :question/answer-fields "0ea15cba-b47b-53c8-a2f1-399c3ef53b26"] [:db/ensure "a10c7c13-1209-5f90-bdd5-131203ee4deb" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "a10c7c13-1209-5f90-bdd5-131203ee4deb"] [:db/add "4de1f349-f6dc-54ee-96db-4863100a47e0" :answer/id #uuid "4de1f349-f6dc-54ee-96db-4863100a47e0"] [:db/add "4de1f349-f6dc-54ee-96db-4863100a47e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4de1f349-f6dc-54ee-96db-4863100a47e0" :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{5} \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "4de1f349-f6dc-54ee-96db-4863100a47e0" :answer/validate] [:db/ad