choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "af28859d-c8c7-5af8-9985-fd7c48aecbac" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{3 x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{3}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{16 - 9 x^{2}}=4\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{3 x}{4})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{4}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot \\frac{4}{3}=1$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{16 - 9 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{4} \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "af28859d-c8c7-5af8-9985-fd7c48aecbac" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "af28859d-c8c7-5af8-9985-fd7c48aecbac" :question/answer-fields "68290687-2cc3-5aca-bbb6-878af00c10b6"] [:db/ensure "af28859d-c8c7-5af8-9985-fd7c48aecbac" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "af28859d-c8c7-5af8-9985-fd7c48aecbac"] [:db/add "3bc3833b-36ef-5491-872d-f6908fb06cf9" :answer/id #uuid "3bc3833b-36ef-5491-872d-f6908fb06cf9"] [:db/add "3bc3833b-36ef-5491-872d-f6908fb06cf9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3bc3833b-36ef-5491-872d-f6908fb06cf9" :answer/value "\\frac{\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{2} \\right)}}{4}+C"] [:db/ensure "3bc3833b-36ef-5491-872d-f6908fb06cf9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0b44de39-c475-59cd-a417-8dab989e180b" :answer/id #uuid "0b44de39-c475-59cd-a417-8dab989e180b"] [:db/add "0b44de39-c475-59cd-a417-8dab989e180b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0b44de39-c475-59cd-a417-8dab989e180b" :answer/value "\\frac{\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{5} \\right)}}{4}+C"] [:db/ensure "0b44de39-c475-59cd-a417-8dab989e180b" :answer/v