-field/correct "2fdb1b6e-90b8-5805-9d20-127870971aad"] [:db/ensure "d1bb9ef5-4e7b-548b-8237-91eb6921047e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "568527d7-4c7d-5e05-b4c1-2798218c4a9c" :question/id #uuid "568527d7-4c7d-5e05-b4c1-2798218c4a9c"] [:db/add "568527d7-4c7d-5e05-b4c1-2798218c4a9c" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{25 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "568527d7-4c7d-5e05-b4c1-2798218c4a9c" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{2 x}{5}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{2}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{25 - 4 x^{2}}=5\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{2 x}{5})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{5}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\frac{5}{2}=\\frac{1}{2}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{25 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{5} \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "568527d7-4c7d-5e05-b4c1-2798218c4a9c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "568527d7-4c7d-5e05-b4c1-2798218c4a9c" :question/answer-fields "d1bb9ef5-4e7b-548b-8237-91eb6921047e"] [:db/ensure "568527d7-4c7d-5e05-b4c1-2798218c4a9c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions "568527d7-4c7d-5e05-b4c1-2798218c4a9c"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "c04d5733-1876-5556-bf56-0d412f7e0525"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/3f/3ffe7a9a142a5dbb443ebfa38d4aa1e786bb4a0f8a874f278e3